https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lojban

Some thoughts on the future of the article.

Some unique Lojbanic expressions
Isn't the glossing frightening here? May be think of better human-friendly
glossing?

Loglan
Shouldn't it be moved into a separate article (like "Comparison of Loglan
and Lojban")?

Lojsk, Voksigid, gua\spi
These three conlangs have a minuscule representation on the web. Do we need
them here? I removed links to them since it is unlikely they will get there
articles but may be remove these sections completely? one of lojban wikis
can store them if someone is afraid of losing this content. xorban and Toaq
Dzu are discussed more. The author of Voksigid worked on newere versions of
this conlang vau ti'e. Should we mention all conlangs whose vocabulary is
initially based on gimste (many do)?

